Glyphs
======
The nine .svg files in this folder are from **Glyphs**, an open icon set.

    Home:    https://glyphs.fyi
    Source:  https://github.com/gorango/glyphs
    Licence: MIT

They ship here under that licence, reproduced verbatim below (including its
name-less copyright line, which is how upstream's own LICENSE file reads).

Two mechanical edits were made to the files, both documented in tools/build_icons.py:
the drawn tint became `currentColor` so a skin can retint them, and stroked paths
carry `vector-effect="non-scaling-stroke"` so the hairline outline survives at this
app's 9-20px icon sizes. The drawings themselves are untouched.

Which file is which is in tools/build_icons.py's ICONS table; the owner's picks are
recorded in moonglade-internal/design/glyphs/README.md — the Glyph Ledger ballot
(2026-09-05) for seven of them, that day's post-audit rulings for books_path and
history_path.


